# BOOST rover: the LEGO BOOST blocks (legoboostunified) drive the Move Hub's built-in motors A and B
# ahead for two seconds, then spin the rover on the spot (B backwards). One block reaches both motors:
# the extension queues one message per motor, 50 ms apart, so B starts 50 ms after A and the rover
# heads a little to the right at the start, as a real BOOST does with these blocks.
WHEN flag clicked:
  boost set motor AB power to 50 %
  boost turn motor AB on for 2 seconds
  boost set motor B direction to backward
  boost turn motor AB on for 180 degrees
